  "body": "Title and CCC have both been issued.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a standalone corner site, this architecturally designed residence offers stylish modern living with beautiful sea views in one of the Eastern Beaches’ most sought-after locations.\r\n\r\nFeaturing 5 spacious bedrooms and a generous 181sqm (mol) floor area, 241sqm (mol) land area. The thoughtfully designed layout provides excellent flexibility for modern family living. A ground-floor bedroom with its own ensuite and private entry is perfect for extended family, guests, teenagers, or potential rental opportunities.\r\n\r\nZoned in Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College, both within walking distance, this is a location highly prized by families seeking top education.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of nearby amenities including Highland Park Shopping Centre, Half Moon Bay Marina ferry to the CBD, Howick Golf Club, and the beach just a short 5-minute stroll away.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n•\t5 spacious bedrooms, including ground-floor ensuite with separate entry\r\n•\tOpen-plan living and dining with modern designer kitchen\r\n•\tMaster suite with walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and sea views\r\n•\tAdditional family lounge upstairs\r\n•\tSingle internal-access garage with EV charger ready\r\n•\tDouble glazing, heat pump, integrated sound system and full security setup\r\n•\tStandalone corner position with extra off-street parking\r\n\r\nA stylish and versatile 5-bedroom family home combining coastal lifestyle, quality design and premium school zoning.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing.",
